    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d82-a2">

                <pb facs="0198" n="98" sameAs="frus:frus1880/pg98"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 2 in No. 175.—Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <p rendition="#flush"><hi rendition="#small-caps">Evarts</hi>, <hi
                        rendition="#italic">Secretary, Washington:</hi></p>
                <p>Cable concerning convention with France received. Foreign office made inquiry
                    relating thereto. Hilliard expected September 1. Shall matter attend his
                    arrival?</p>
                <closer><signed>WHITE, <hi rendition="#italic">Chargé.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
